  "worked_solution": "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\times v & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 4 & 5 & -1 \\\\ -6 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}5 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}4 & -1 \\\\ -6 & 2\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}4 & 5 \\\\ -6 & 0\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(5\\cdot 2-(-1)\\cdot 0)i-(4\\cdot 2-(-1)\\cdot (-6))j+(4\\cdot 0-5\\cdot (-6))k \\\\  & =(10-0)i-(8-6)j+(0-(-30))k \\\\  & =10i-2j+30k.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
